<app-page title="Tabs" description="用于把相关内容组织成可快速切换的并列分区，适合分段视图、筛选和内容分组。" tone="{{tone}}" withBack="{{true}}">
  <view class="{{surfaceClassName}}">
    <view class="{{titleClassName}}">Basic</view>
    <view class="{{descriptionClassName}}">horizontal + panel (size=md radius=full)</view>

    <sr-tabs
      className="mt-3"
      items="{{basicTabs}}"
      value="{{basicValue}}"
      tone="{{tone}}"
      size="md"
      radius="full"
      bind:change="handleBasicChange"
    >
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-1"
        activeValue="{{basicValue}}"
        className="{{panelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab 1
      </sr-tab-panel>
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-2"
        activeValue="{{basicValue}}"
        className="{{panelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab 2
      </sr-tab-panel>
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-3"
        activeValue="{{basicValue}}"
        className="{{panelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab 3
      </sr-tab-panel>
    </sr-tabs>
  </view>

  <view class="{{surfaceClassName}}">
    <view class="{{titleClassName}}">Vertical</view>
    <view class="{{descriptionClassName}}">
      placement=top/start/end/bottom + variant=underline
    </view>

    <view class="mt-3">
      <sr-button-group size="sm" isBlock>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{placementValue === 'top' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{placementValue === 'top' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-placement="top"
          bind:tap="handlePlacementTap"
        >
          top
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{placementValue === 'start' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{placementValue === 'start' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-placement="start"
          bind:tap="handlePlacementTap"
        >
          start
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{placementValue === 'end' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{placementValue === 'end' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-placement="end"
          bind:tap="handlePlacementTap"
        >
          end
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{placementValue === 'bottom' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{placementValue === 'bottom' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-placement="bottom"
          bind:tap="handlePlacementTap"
        >
          bottom
        </sr-button>
      </sr-button-group>
    </view>

    <sr-tabs
      className="mt-3 h-44"
      placement="{{placementValue}}"
      items="{{verticalTabs}}"
      value="{{verticalValue}}"
      tone="{{tone}}"
      variant="underline"
      color="primary"
      size="sm"
      radius="none"
      bind:change="handleVerticalChange"
    >
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-a"
        activeValue="{{verticalValue}}"
        className="{{verticalPanelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab A
      </sr-tab-panel>
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-b"
        activeValue="{{verticalValue}}"
        className="{{verticalPanelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab B
      </sr-tab-panel>
      <sr-tab-panel
        value="tab-c"
        activeValue="{{verticalValue}}"
        className="{{verticalPanelClassName}}"
      >
        Panel for Tab C (disabled tab)
      </sr-tab-panel>
    </sr-tabs>
  </view>

  <view class="{{surfaceClassName}}">
    <view class="{{titleClassName}}">Variant / Color</view>
    <view class="{{descriptionClassName}}">default / outline / twotone / underline</view>

    <view class="mt-3">
      <sr-button-group size="sm" isBlock>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{activeVariant === 'default' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{activeVariant === 'default' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-variant="default"
          bind:tap="handleVariantTap"
        >
          default
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{activeVariant === 'outline' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{activeVariant === 'outline' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-variant="outline"
          bind:tap="handleVariantTap"
        >
          outline
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{activeVariant === 'twotone' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{activeVariant === 'twotone' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-variant="twotone"
          bind:tap="handleVariantTap"
        >
          twotone
        </sr-button>
        <sr-button
          class="flex-1"
          tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
          color="{{activeVariant === 'underline' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}"
          variant="{{activeVariant === 'underline' ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
          data-variant="underline"
          bind:tap="handleVariantTap"
        >
          underline
        </sr-button>
      </sr-button-group>
    </view>

    <view class="mt-2 flex flex-col gap-2">
      <block
        wx:for="{{colorGroups}}"
        wx:for-item="group"
        wx:for-index="groupIndex"
        wx:key="groupIndex"
      >
        <sr-button-group size="sm" isBlock>
          <block wx:for="{{group}}" wx:for-item="option" wx:key="value">
            <sr-button
              class="flex-1"
              tone="{{tone === 'dark' ? 'dark' : 'light'}}"
              color="{{activeColor === option.value ? option.value : 'default'}}"
              variant="{{activeColor === option.value ? 'solid' : 'flat'}}"
              data-color="{{option.value}}"
              bind:tap="handleColorTap"
            >
              {{option.label}}
            </sr-button>
          </block>
        </sr-button-group>
      </block>
    </view>

    <sr-tabs
      className="mt-3"
      items="{{colorTabs}}"
      value="{{colorValue}}"
      tone="{{tone}}"
      color="{{activeColor}}"
      variant="{{activeVariant}}"
      bind:change="handleColorChange"
    />

    <view class="{{metaTextClassName}}">
      Variant: {{activeVariant}} / Color: {{activeColor}} / Selected: {{colorValue}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="{{surfaceClassName}}">
    <view class="{{titleClassName}}">Tabs Only</view>
    <view class="{{descriptionClassName}}">
      external custom panel (e.g. swiper / business container)
    </view>

    <sr-tabs
      className="mt-3"
      items="{{customPanelTabs}}"
      value="{{customValue}}"
      tone="{{tone}}"
      size="md"
      radius="md"
      bind:change="handleCustomChange"
    />

    <view class="{{externalPanelClassName}}">
      <view wx:if="{{customValue === 'tab-1'}}">External Panel: Tab 1</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{customValue === 'tab-2'}}">External Panel: Tab 2</view>
      <view wx:else>External Panel: Tab 3</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="{{surfaceClassName}}">
    <view class="{{titleClassName}}">Long List</view>
    <view class="{{descriptionClassName}}">virtualized tabs + edge tap auto shift</view>

    <sr-tabs
      className="mt-3"
      items="{{longTabs}}"
      value="{{longValue}}"
      tone="{{tone}}"
      radius="full"
      estimateSize="{{88}}"
      bind:change="handleLongChange"
    />

    <view class="{{metaTextClassName}}">Selected: {{longValue}}</view>
  </view>
</app-page>
